# Project docs

Start from `docs/map.md`, then `docs/patterns.md` and `docs/testing.md`. Do **not** grep the whole repo to learn how a subsystem works — open the one linked doc, then the files it names.

## When behavior changes

Update the matching file under `docs/` **in the same turn** (map row + the feature doc). New admin module = `docs/map.md` + `docs/acl.md` + `docs/add-admin-section.md`.

Do not write a second architecture in chat. Keep docs short; they are an index, not a dump of the source.

## Must not skip

- Admin mutations: `requireAdminResource` / `runMassActions` / `requireAdminSection` (see `docs/acl.md`)
- New behavior: unit test in `tests/Unit/` (see `docs/testing.md`)
- Keep `tests/Unit/Contract/SecurityContractTest.php` green
